p_shared_sources":"done","steps_applicable":"8","steps_done":"2"},"readiness_blockers":[{"step":"original_text","what":"no official original-text candidate from any job"},{"step":"clause_inventory","what":"no clause inventory drafted"},{"step":"ending_or_current_basis","what":"provisional NO, but no job found a whole-order-end candidate"}],"schema":"eo-case-bundle/v1","status":"no","text_pointers":[{"first_1500_characters":"Wanted: EO::12107\nCited by: EO:10641, EO:11096, EO:11639, EO:9738\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1979-01-03/pdf/FR-1979-01-03.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: 2bbe84367ac61a00fa9305998fc1ffef94854553ab085e5eeed81296a09c918b\nLocation: 44 FR 1055, PDF pages 321-330\nMachine-extracted text (from a scan's text layer for older documents). Not an authenticated transcription; check the PDF.\n\n=== PDF page 321 of 336 ===\nTHE PRESIDENT 1055\n[3195-01-M ]\nExecutive O rder 12107 •  December 28, 1978\nRelating to the Civil Service Commission and Labor-Management in the Federal Service\nBy virtue o f the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution \nand statutes o f the United States o f America, and by Section 403 o f Reorgani­\nzation Plan No. 2 o f 1978 (43 FR 36037), it is hereby ordered as follows:\nSectio n 1\nIM PLEM EN TA TIO N  OF R EO R G A NIZA TIO N  PLAN N O . 2 OF 1978\n1-1. O ffic e  o f  P erson n el M a n a gem en t.\n1-101 . E sta b lish m en t o f  O ffic e  o f  P erson n el M a n a gem en t. The establishment o f \nthe Office o f Personnel Management and o f the positions o f Director,* Deputy \nDirector, and Associate Directors o f that Office, as provided in Sections 101 \nand 103 o f Reorganization Plan No. 2 o f 1978, shall be effective on January 1, \n1979.\n1-102. T ra n s fe r o f  F u n ctio n s . Section 102 o f Reorganization Plan No. 2 o f \n1978, transferring functions to the Director o f the Office o f Personnel Man­\nagement, shall be effect","path":"jobs/source-ladder/output/texts/EO_12107_152fcfaf0e.txt","sha256":"691d64e70cb6475e263c96d43fe5d26079022916085095fb2c644dd8d22f051b","source":{"line":29,"path":"jobs/source-ladder/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"478bb29cf611ae398d07c53a0aa09ad288d7fd0bcacfb40dfff837b5ab937c0d"}}]}
